Package: counterpath
Type: Package
Title: Temporal and Counterfactual Trajectory Visualization
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Iman", "Sadeghi", email = "i.sadeghi@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Renders time-resolved and counterfactual trajectories as confidence fans, highlighting what would have happened under alternative interventions.
    Part of the bioviz suite of ten complementary visualization modules
    for advanced bioinformatics analysis and publication-grade figures.
